# Team AI Flow (router)

**Opt-in** — user gọi command hoặc nói phase/harness/feature mới thì agent mới đọc skill.

→ Public skills: `.cursor/skills/{design,legacy-spec,model,test,api,wire,unit}/SKILL.md`
→ Doc: `docs/TEAM-AI-WORKFLOW.md`  
→ Vendor local: `~/.cursor/skills-vendor/INDEX.md`
→ Related projects example: `.cursor/team-projects.example.json`

Command map:

| Command | Work |
|---|---|
| `/design` | `.cursor/skills/design/SKILL.md` — verify/update spec, optional legacy evidence, docs, real prototype with mocked API responses only |
| `/legacy-spec` | `.cursor/skills/legacy-spec/SKILL.md` — analyze code into design spec/testcase, no production edits |
| `/model` | `.cursor/skills/model/SKILL.md` — Zod schemas and TS types in `models/` only |
| `/test` | `.cursor/skills/test/SKILL.md` — testcase YAML + Playwright E2E |
| `/api` | `.cursor/skills/api/SKILL.md` — backend API in configured backend project |
| `/wire` | `.cursor/skills/wire/SKILL.md` — replace mocked API boundary with real API |
| `/unit` | `.cursor/skills/unit/SKILL.md` — Vitest logic tests |

Một session = **một** command/phase skill. State: `.harness/progress.md`.

Related repos: dùng `~/.cursor/team-projects.json` hoặc `.cursor/team-projects.local.json` để map FE/API/worker/legacy liên quan; không cần mở tất cả repo trong cùng workspace.
